<view class="account-page f7-ios-theme f7-identity-screen">
  <wu-f7-block spacing="compact">
    <view class="status-line" aria-role="status"> {{message}} </view>
    <view class="consent-note">
      你同意后，授权码会发送至微信官方接口，用于验证手机号归属。鲸语不保存或展示手机号，不以此确认学生身份。
    </view>
    <view class="caption">
      设备只保留原请求编号以恢复结果。服务需单独启用并满足微信账号资格、隐私声明要求，目前尚未完成真机验收。
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{requestId}}" class="request-id" selectable="true">
      原请求：{{requestId}}
    </view>
    <wu-f7-button
      wx:if="{{phase === 'idle' || phase === 'not_found'}}"
      class="primary"
      disabled="{{busy || !hasSession || !configured}}"
      bind:press="onPrepare"
      variant="fill"
      size="large"
    >
      同意用途，准备授权
    </wu-f7-button>
    <wu-f7-button
      wx:if="{{phase === 'unknown' || phase === 'expired' || phase === 'closed'}}"
      class="secondary"
      disabled="{{busy || !hasSession}}"
      bind:press="onPrepare"
      variant="tonal"
      size="normal"
    >
      结束原请求，准备新授权
    </wu-f7-button>
    <wu-f7-button
      wx:if="{{phase === 'verified'}}"
      class="secondary"
      disabled="{{busy || !hasSession}}"
      bind:press="onPrepare"
      variant="tonal"
      size="normal"
    >
      准备新的微信授权
    </wu-f7-button>
    <button
      wx:if="{{phase === 'reserved'}}"
      class="primary"
      open-type="getPhoneNumber"
      bindgetphonenumber="onPhone"
      disabled="{{busy || !hasSession}}"
    >
      同意微信手机号授权并验证
    </button>
    <wu-f7-button
      wx:if="{{requestId}}"
      class="secondary"
      disabled="{{busy || !hasSession}}"
      bind:press="onRecover"
      variant="tonal"
      size="normal"
    >
      查询原请求结果
    </wu-f7-button>
    <wu-f7-button
      wx:if="{{phase === 'reserved' || phase === 'unknown' || phase === 'expired'}}"
      class="quiet"
      disabled="{{busy}}"
      bind:press="onClose"
      variant="plain"
      size="normal"
    >
      关闭原请求
    </wu-f7-button>
  </wu-f7-block>
  <wu-f7-block
    wx:if="{{phase === 'processing'}}"
    class="surface"
    strong="{{true}}"
    inset="{{true}}"
    spacing="compact"
  >
    <view class="inline-icon">
      <wu-icon name="clock" tone="accent" size="22" />
      <view class="section-title"> 正在确认授权 </view>
    </view>
    <view class="body-copy">
      请稍后查询原请求。处理中不能重新授权，结果未知时也不会重发授权码。
    </view>
  </wu-f7-block>
  <wu-f7-list strong="{{true}}" inset="{{true}}" spacing="compact">
    <navigator class="link-row" url="/pages/verification/verification">
      <wu-f7-list-item title-slot="{{true}}" after-slot="{{true}}">
        <text class="link-label" slot="title"> 返回认证状态 </text>
        <wu-icon name="chevron-right" size="16" tone="muted" slot="after" />
      </wu-f7-list-item>
    </navigator>
  </wu-f7-list>
  <wu-f7-block spacing="compact">
    <navigator
      wx:if="{{!hasSession}}"
      class="text-link"
      url="/pages/login/login"
      open-type="reLaunch"
    >
      前往登录
    </navigator>
  </wu-f7-block>
</view>
